#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: latin-address-checkout.php
msgid "Latin Address Checkout"
msgstr "Latin Address Checkout"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: latin-address-checkout.php
msgid "https://github.com/headwalluk/latin-address-checkout"
msgstr "https://github.com/headwalluk/latin-address-checkout"

#. Description of the plugin
#: latin-address-checkout.php
msgid "Converts accented and typographic characters in WooCommerce checkout addresses to plain ASCII, and asks the customer to re-enter anything that can't be converted, for carriers that only accept ASCII."
msgstr "Converts accented and typographic characters in WooCommerce checkout addresses to plain ASCII, and asks the customer to re-enter anything that can't be converted, for carriers that only accept ASCII."

